      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BILLS ANGEL (5) has started to show early pace in her races recently and that has also seen an improvement in the results. She was close up two back then led and kept going over this very course and distance. Could easily see a carbon copy. QUALITY MISS (7) did run favourite three weeks back at Gatton. She is clearly enjoying racing around this type of trip. Will be right there all the way. CARACORON (3) showed more last outing than most recent ones. Gets some weight relief and usually runs well here. SUN TOPAZE (2) had been going well before the last effort in Brisbane. This is easier company. JUSTICE SERVED (1) comes back to the turf. Is one from one at this track and has some blinkers added.",
